msgid "A space-separated list of HTML %1$sclass%2$s values. %1$s<table>%2$s elements with these classes will automatically be enhanced with %3$sjQuery DataTables%4$s, unless the given table also has the special %1$sno-datatables%2$s class. Leave blank to use the plugin default."
msgstr ""

#: inline-gdocs-viewer.php:2027
msgid "DataTables defaults object"
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: opening link tag to json.org, 2: closing link tag, 3: opening link tag to the DataTables manual, 4: opening link tag to the plugin documentation.
#: inline-gdocs-viewer.php:2038
#, php-format
msgid "Define a DataTables defaults initialization object (in %1$sJSON%2$s syntax). This is useful if you wish to change the default DataTables enhancements for all affected tables on your site at once. All DataTables-enhanced tables will use the DataTables options configured here unless explicitly overriden in the shortcode, HTML, or JavaScript initialization for the given table, itself. To learn more, read the %3$sDataTables manual section on Setting defaults%2$s and refer to the %4$sdocumentation for shortcode attributes available via this plugin%2$s. Leave blank to use the plugin default."
msgstr ""

#: inline-gdocs-viewer.php:2047
msgid "Load table scripts on every page?"
msgstr ""

#: inline-gdocs-viewer.php:2051
msgid "By default, DataTables loads only on pages that show this plugin's shortcode. Turn this on if you write tables with the DataTables classes by hand, so they are enhanced on every page."
msgstr ""

